text msg_0122_D39R0101_00002 {
    "The item you picked up over there...\n"
    "it was an HM, wasn’t it?\r"
    "I am the one who dropped it...but I\n"
    "want you to keep it.\f"
    "You took the time to get it, right?\r"
    "It contains Waterfall.\n"
    "Have fun climbing waterfalls!\r"
    "Me?\r"
    "I still need a new pair of shoes\n"
    "before I can enjoy waterfalls."
}

text msg_0122_D39R0101_00001 {
    "You see the item over there?\r"
    "It was me who dropped it, but I cannot\n"
    "get over there to pick it up.\r"
    "Why?\r"
    "Walking on ice makes your feet freeze!\r"
    "My shoes are so worn that the soles\n"
    "are gone!\r"
}

